Brain extraction for the Neurodesk brain extraction web app and command line.

BET: Smith SM. Fast robust automated brain extraction. Human Brain Mapping
17(3):143-155, 2002. https://doi.org/10.1002/hbm.10062
The BET implementation is qsm-core (QSM.rs) by Ashley Stewart, MIT license:
https://github.com/astewartau/QSM.rs
wasm/bet.wasm is compiled from commit 95be94b83b43e80329b4ecfe8a74cf8114ea927a
by bet-wasm/ and scripts/build-bet-wasm.sh, shared by the browser and command line.
Its MIT license is in wasm/LICENSE.

SynthStrip: Hoopes A, Mora JS, Dalca AV, Fischl B, Hoffmann M. SynthStrip:
skull-stripping for any brain image. NeuroImage 260:119474, 2022.
https://doi.org/10.1016/j.neuroimage.2022.119474
